{"id":"en_a-fall-that-brings-fortune","title":"A Fall That Brings Fortune","titleEn":"A Fall That Brings Fortune","description":"Chen Fan, a young man from the present day, finds himself pulled into a game world where princesses are part of everyday life. There he relies on his cleverness and his gift for poetry to work through the obstacles placed before him, climbing the ranks step by step while discovering new openings along the way. The result is a lighthearted, playful adventure built around wit and unexpected chances. Those who want to follow the series and its episodes can do so on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/a-fall-that-brings-fortune/en_US/e34db6d32d7c0298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/a-fall-that-brings-fortune/en_US/e34db6d32d7c0298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Chosen One","Adventure","Superpower","Time Travel","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dm38y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_a-fall-that-brings-fortune_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dm38y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_a-fall-that-brings-fortune_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dm38y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_a-fall-that-brings-fortune_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dm38y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_a-fall-that-brings-fortune_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dm38y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","do